---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Grok Bot" description="What Grok Bot is: AI teammates that can use tools and return finished work.">
  <section class="about-content">
    <p class="home-kicker" style="margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">Products</p>
    <h1 class="page-title">Grok Bot</h1>
    <p class="page-subtitle muted">AI teammates that act with tools, not only chat.</p>
    <p><strong>Grok Bot</strong> is xAI's product framing for agent-style teammates. Official descriptions emphasise signing into tools, performing real work, and returning finished results.</p>
    <h2>What Grok Bot is for</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Task-oriented work with connected tools</li>
      <li>Multi-step assistance aimed at completing an outcome</li>
      <li>A teammate-style interface rather than pure Q&amp;A</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="muted" style="margin-top: 2rem;"><a href="/products">← All products</a></p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>